  "description": "GEDCOM CLI and MCP server for AI-assisted family-history research. Parses and writes GEDCOM 5.5/7.0, generates a static family-page site, and exposes find_person/get_record/get_document_stats/date_calc/describe_changeset_ops/validate_changeset/check_plausibility/apply_changeset tools over MCP so an agent like Claude can research your tree and apply reviewed findings -- kept as reviewable JSON changesets and, with the optional --read-only flag, never written without a human in the loop.",
